              "Four months (Nov. 30th, 1926)"
            ],
            [
              "",
              "(C) Distribution between the Central Government and the various Provinces as compensation. ...",
              "Dec. 1st, 1926.",
              "Fifteenth months (Feb. 29th, 1928)"
            ],
